<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="dp41-comparison" name="04-41. VIA 요청 이해의 모델 주도와 코드 주도 완성"><mxGraphModel dx="1920" dy="1080" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1080" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="n1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="0" width="1920" height="1080" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA SOFTWARE ARCHITECTURE / DP 설계 비교&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#087E8B;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="22" width="1300" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;구조 비교 / 장단점 / QA Trade-off&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1430" y="22" width="450" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;04-41. VIA 요청 이해의 모델 주도와 코드 주도 완성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=39;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="65" width="1840" height="50.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="121" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="121" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;“이 표를 아까 보고서에 넣고, 메일은 보내지 말고 결과를 바탕으로 초안만 만들어.”&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=23;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="140" width="1840" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Task1: 예산 보고서 / Task2: 실적 보고서 → “어느 보고서인가요?” → 사용자: “예산 보고서” / 결과: 수정된 보고서 → 메일 초안&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="169" width="1840" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=#D5E7C7;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="195" width="1840" height="48" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;설계안&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="41.0" y="209" width="98" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3000000000000003;&quot;&gt;A 모델 주도 해석&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=26;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="156.0" y="205" width="838" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3000000000000003;&quot;&gt;B 모델 요청 틀과 코드 주도 완성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=26;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1026.0" y="205" width="838" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="1010" y="195" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1010" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="795" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;공통 후속 처리: Request Controller가 현재성/권한을 검증하고 저장 후 채택한다. 이어 응답 또는 업무 위임을 진행한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="810" width="1840" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;반복 종료: 완성 의미 제안 / 확인 질문 대기 / 실패 / 취소 / 한도 도달. 질문 답변 뒤 다시 해석한다. 무한 반복을 허용하지 않는다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="840" width="1840" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="875" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="875" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;정확성 / 지원 범위&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="883" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;열린 의미를 함께 판단 / 검색 누락과 모델 오판 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="883" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;지원 관계의 코드 결합 / 틀 오류와 표현 밖 관계의 한계&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="883" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="909" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="909" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;응답성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="917" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;조회 후 재판단마다 클라우드 왕복 / 부분 수정 허용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="917" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;지원 틀이 충분하면 재판단 축소 / 추가 해석과 질문 대기&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="917" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="943" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="943" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;모델 호출 비용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="951" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;반복 해석과 긴 Context가 비용 증가 요인&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="951" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;초기 틀 + 필요한 부분 해석 / 항상 1회라는 전제 없음&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="951" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="977" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="977" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;변경 용이성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="985" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;새 관계는 모델 지침/조회 도구 변경 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="985" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;요청 틀과 코드 규칙 확장 / 기존 지원 관계는 코드 제어&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="985" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;미선정 / 미측정. B도 부분 의미 판단을 다시 호출할 수 있다. 새 관계의 지원 범위와 질문 비용을 함께 비교한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1032" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;A도 정해진 형식으로 출력 가능 / B도 추가 모델 호출 가능 / 코드로 연결했다고 의미가 항상 옳은 것은 아님 / 품질/비용은 측정 전 가설&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1060" width="1840" height="18.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="47" y="342" width="86" height="447" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="49.0" y="351" width="82" height="19.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="53" y="379" width="74" height="27" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n37" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Component&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="62.0" y="386.0" width="56" height="13.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n38" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;논리 책임&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="54" y="409" width="76" height="14.399999999999999" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n39" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="53" y="438" width="74" height="27" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n40" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Module&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="62.0" y="445.0" width="56" height="13.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n41" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;내부 구현&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="g